<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>N点工具路径重开完整自审核</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../plugins/N-POINT-PATH-REOPEN-AUDIT.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="n点工具路径重开完整自审核">N点工具路径重开完整自审核</h1><p>2026-10-19。复用最终435文件快照SHA82A789C3305AEE17AE459671630D88AC4AE4C83EB94C953B76D8DD9055E2197C及7日志，未重跑数学。本页更正先前整工具“无缺口”的结论：以下实际UI路径差异修复/验证前不得恢复计数。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>活动链</th>
<th>自审结论与现有证据</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>资源/Reset/数组/教学/算法</td>
<td>复用N-POINT-FINAL-IMPLEMENTATION-EXIT中的Reset36/Numeric12/Text43/Alias35/Plugin5817，无新算法差异</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>OpenFile路径</td>
<td>原OpenFileForCalibDialog→ValueChanged同Translation；现Attach已接source门，picker无条件history/force重试。root五消费者专项在跑，尚不提前写通过</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>路径成功通知</td>
<td>NPointConfiguration旧专属Lang_SetSuc与新Attach.Completed重复。原只有一次；候选删专属一次，必须实际验证</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>显式Save</td>
<td>原SaveFileDialog.SaveLocalFile先Filter.Split长度2、FileName.EndsWith第一段（CurrentCulture大小写敏感），再IUserStringData→CalibPathName GetParam→history→Success。产品旧Export OrdinalIgnoreCase会放行.XML，且额外UI长度260门无本体证据。候选按真实SaveCalibPath/FileOption复原前置门，专属Config补大写拒绝</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>状态/保存</td>
<td>原有Configuration53覆盖真实成功保存及取消，Host32整方案重载/点表与样式身份；PrepareSave把32×5表从scope写入文档，保第6内部角度不新增持久化字段</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>释放/失败恢复</td>
<td>Host32已核配置关闭disposed、重开、clear退化失败隐藏旧path/axis、恢复成功、再次关闭；execution.Changed解绑并DisposeAsync。未声称native地址相同</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>候选在analysis/n-point-calibration/path-reopen，未改冻结产品、不build。旧Config wrong.txt回滚断言同步改成attempt/backend分离；不是继续保留旧行为。远程/root仍显式Unsupported，设备/任意native heap和外界provider不扩成本工具数学缺口。人工验收不计进度。</p>
<h2 id="save路径读回原指令">Save路径读回原指令</h2><p>原SetParam 18003e560 SaveCalibPath：33420校验.xml→WriteXmlData成功0后才清this+15da1共30c字节并memcpy_s(path,30b)。原GetParam 180039c20.asm的39ef4..39f2d（SaveCalibPath）及39f66..39f9f（CalibPathName）均把this+15da1放入格式化参数，二者同缓存。因此正常短路径导出成功后的selected path确为模块读回值；失败保旧值。native超长buffer/invalid-parameter handler不从托管路径长度规则猜造等价。</p>
